)v-3=5\n$$\n\nwhere $k$ is a constant. Given that this equation has no solution, what is the value of $k?$\n\n$k=$\n{{field-1}}" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186297202 #edb/ref 1072 #uuid "e9e21b0c-1002-52c2-8ff0-0958a8c28640" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186297202 #edb/ref 1074 "Suppose we have an equation of the form\n\n$$\nax=b\n$$\n\nwhere $a$ and $b$ are constants, and $b\\ne 0.$ If $a=0,$ then the equation has no solution.\n\nFirst, let's write our equation in the form $av=b:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}(k-2)v-3 & =5 \\\\ (k-2)v-3+3 & =5+3 \\\\ {{(k-2)}_{⏟}}_{a}v & ={{8}_{⏟}}_{b}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the equation has no solution if\n\n$$\nk-2=0.\n$$\n\nSolving this for $k,$ we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}k-2 & =0 \\\\ k & =2.\\end{aligned}\n$$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186476177 #edb/ref 1168 "generate/scratch/17592186204089.py" #edb/ref 17592186045443] [17592186476177 #edb/ref 1169 #uuid "df447172-a77c-50e5-86de-f7d553d36810" #edb/ref 17592186045443] [17592186477030 #edb/ref 1068 #edb/ref 17592186477027 #edb/ref 17592186045443] [17592186477030 #edb/ref 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045485 #edb/ref 17592186045443] [17592186477030 #edb/ref 1071 "Consider the equation in the variable $z,$ given by\n\n$$\n(p+2)z-8=-3\n$$\n\nwhere $p$ is a constant. Given that this equation has no solution, what is the value of $p?$\n\n$p=$\n{{field-1}}" #edb/ref 17592186045443] [17592186477030 #edb/ref 1072 #uuid "241cddc7-1f2f-5859-9ab9-bb4fe4e92884" #edb/ref 17592186045443] [17592186477030 #edb/ref 1074 "Suppose we have an equation of the form\n\n$$\nax=b\n$$\n\nwhere $a$ and $b$ are constants, and $b\\ne 0.$ If $a=0,$ then the equation has no solution.\n\nFirst, let's write our equation in the form $az=b:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}(p+2)z-8 & =-3 \\\\ (p+2)z-8+8 & =-3+8 \\\\ {{(p+2)}_{⏟}}_{a}z & ={{5}_{⏟}}_{b}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the equation has no solution if\n\n$$\np+2=0.\n$$\n\nSolving this for $p,$ we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}p+2 & =0 \\\\ p & =-2.\\end